{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>西灣河發生虐畜案。昨日（15日）下午1時許，警方接獲途人報案，發現一名年約50歲本地女子將一隻狗從太安街29號海濱公園岸邊扔下海，其後撿起該狗隻逃去。</p><p>警員接報到場，經初步調查後，案件列作「殘酷對待動物」，交由東區警區刑事調查隊第一隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p><figure><img alt=\"案件列作「殘酷對待動物」，交由東區警區刑事調查隊跟進。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187556903606030336794681.jpeg/vBlTiecHDe8rWagjwj0mEkpuia6xHlvMsWjB-Ytowfk\"/><figcaption>案件列作「殘酷對待動物」，交由東區警區刑事調查隊跟進。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T16:39:04.436709+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T16:31:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T02:57:57.494700+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T16:37:36.120586+00:00","content_hash":"8c99d56ae3e5e05929efc3aec96c2de9ddb16cf0bf2eaf241edaa3b3ccda8277","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}